# supervision: the closed list of states of the machine "Supervision and watcher".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
off	initial	rest	no session holds the lock
starting	-	active	a session takes the lock and starts the watcher
watching	-	rest	the session waits for a wake
handling	-	active	the session handles the wakes it drained
read-only	-	waiting	the session could not take the lock and may change nothing
